<title>USA: Sioux City hogs steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were fully</p>
<p>steady. Top $60.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     60.00</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     59.00-59.50</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     57.00-58.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     53.50-56.50</p>
<p>Sows:  1.00 lower on very thin test. US 1-3   300-500 lbs     47.00</p>
<p>	   500-700 lbs     scarce</p>
</text>
